# Continuity

At the start of work on an ongoing project, call the Continuity MCP tool `resume_context`. Treat 🔒 FROZEN and 🚫 rejected items as authoritative.

Default to capturing nothing. Only record what a future session cannot re-derive:
- settled decision → `record_decision` (or batch via `capture`)
- standing instruction / constraint → `record_constraint`
- rejected alternative → `record_rejection` (reason required)
- open / risk / milestone / next action → `record_open`

Prefer `capture` for batches (dedupe + frozen-guard). Freeze, why, resolve, and mission replace only on explicit user request.

Full policy: see `skills/continuity/SKILL.md`.
